@startuml

|Renter|
start
:Selects facility, date, time, and event type;

|Website|
:Check availability;

if (Facility available?) then ([available])
       |Renter|
       :Enter contact information;
       :Submit request;

       |Website|
       :Record request;
       :Send request for review;

       |School Staff|
       :Review request;

else ([not available])
        :Show not available;
        |Renter|
        if (Try another date?) then ([choose another date])
            :Choose another date/time;
            |Website|
            :Check availability again;
            note right
              A new facility selection should loop back to the beginning
            end note
            stop
        else ([stop])
            :Stop request;
            stop
        endif



|School Staff|
:Check availability;

|Payment Service|
:Process Payment;

if (Payment Successful?) then ([success])
            :Save booking;


else ([fail])
               :Record payment failure;


|Email Service|
:Check availability;


@enduml